WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.720
Stay Close
is an eight-part thriller

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.320
available to watch now
on Netflix

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.880
that follows four
intertwined lives.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.560
There's bride-to-be Cassie,
played by Cush Jumbo,

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.040
Richard Armitage's
troubled photographer Ray,

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.520
Detective Michael Broome,
played by James Nesbitt,

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.160
and Sarah Parish
as nightclub owner Lorraine.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.600
Oh, and a huge
pile of bodies

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.280
growing between them.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:22.560
If you've already watched it
and are trying to untangle

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:23.520
this web of lies

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.600
or just want to track
who killed who,

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.440
then this video
is here to help.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.200
From the shock killer
of Carlton Flynn

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.400
to the bizarre antics
of Barbie and Ken,

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.960
this is Stay Close:
Explained.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.920
And if you haven't
watched the show yet,

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.400
maybe do that first,

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.320
as this will completely
explain a number of twists.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.440
At first glance, Stay Close
is about the search

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.840
for a missing teenager,
Carlton Flynn,

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.800
but the trail to his body

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.080
crosses with
multiple murders

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.560
and causes a few more
to take place.

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:57.280
So it's maybe easier
to break down

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:59.520
some of the mysteries
around that first.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.480
Let's also keep
a death count running.

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:05.760
What are Ken
and Barbie up to?

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.320
When Carlton Flynn
goes missing

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.080
on the night
of a local carnival,

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:13.440
his dad, Del Flynn,
turns to the law for help.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:15.960
He's an important
local businessman

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.440
and that applies extra
pressure to the police.

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:20.800
Detective Broome
is asked by his boss

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.000
and amateur magician,
Goldberg,

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:24.120
to make it a priority.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:26.960
Take your coffee
and get yourself over there.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.440
Little does Broome know
that Del, driven by worry,

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:32.200
has also employed
the services

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:36.000
of two theatrical assassins,
Barbie and Ken,

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:37.240
to search for Carlton.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.080
Fed information
on the investigation

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:40.600
by bent copper Goldberg,

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.320
the duo hunt down
potential witnesses

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:44.560
and torture them to death
for information.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:47.640
This includes exotic dancer
Tawny Allure,

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:49.520
and Harry Sutton,

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:51.640
a lawyer who looks out
for the dancers

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:53.280
and wrestles
with a drug addiction

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:56.800
that Del's assassins use
to fake a fatal overdose.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.040
They also target Megan

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:00.400
by kidnapping her daughter,
Kayleigh.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.160
But the enterprising
stripper turned super mum

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:04.440
manages to rescue
her daughter.

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:08.720
When Goldberg refuses
to help our pair

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.560
of harmonious hit men
any further,

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:11.800
they strangle him

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:13.880
and go after
their targets directly.

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:15.040
Big mistake.

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:17.600
Barbie is killed
in a fight with Megan.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.760
And Ken is sliced
by Lorraine.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:24.320
More on her in a moment.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.560
The important
takeaway from this

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:28.720
is that despite
adding five bodies

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:30.040
to the overall count,

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:33.000
Barbie and Ken are not
part of the bigger picture,

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:35.640
although they certainly
make it a groovier picture.

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:40.120
Is Stewart Green alive?

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.040
When Carlton Flynn
goes missing,

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:44.600
it catches Broome's
attention for a reason.

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:47.000
He vanishes exactly 17 years

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:49.000
after a man
called Stewart Green,

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:51.360
an unsolved case
that still haunts the cop.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:52.960
It's a serial killer.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:54.840
I can feel it.

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.240
Stewart Green is the main
connective tissue

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.360
between Megan,
our mum of the year,

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:02.600
Ray, a jilted
photographer for hire,

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:05.240
Broome, the detective trying
to make sense of it all,

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:06.920
and the mystery killer.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:09.440
Seventeen years ago,
before Megan was Megan,

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:10.800
she was Cassie,

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.680
an exotic dancer
in a relationship with Ray,

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.240
a man so love-struck,

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:17.120
he proposed with a plastic
ring from a crane game.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.080
But Cassie was also being
stalked by Stewart Green,

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:23.720
an abusive punter
who would harass the dancers

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.200
and made her fear
for her life.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.880
He stalked me,

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:28.360
and he threatened
to kill me.

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:32.040
He was crazy.

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:34.760
It's hinted that she and Ray

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:36.880
were involved
with Green's disappearance,

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:38.320
which is why Cassie fled

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.280
and reinvented herself
as Megan,

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:44.120
leaving Ray to obsess
over the one that got away.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.400
Back in the present day,

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:47.880
Megan is visited
by Lorraine,

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:50.720
her boss from her days
dancing at the Viper Club.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:53.720
Lorraine says she's seen
Stewart Green alive.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:54.680
He's back.

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:56.080
He's dead, Lorraine.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:58.280
But this is a lie.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.680
She made up the story
to re-enter Megan's life.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:01.960
But how does that explain

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:03.480
the bald man
in the dragon suit

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:04.520
who was following Megan

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:07.440
and delivers one of her old
dancing leaflets to her son?

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.320
This is a big,
bald red herring.

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:14.600
The mystery man
is Vipers bouncer Rudy,

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:17.040
who believes Megan stole
money from him and Stewart

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:18.600
17 years ago.

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:20.120
He still owed me my cut.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:21.920
No, it turns out

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.560
Stewart Green was killed
17 years ago,

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:25.840
add one to the body count,

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:27.760
and that both Megan and Ray

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:29.120
thought the other
was responsible.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.560
You'd already killed him.

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:35.160
No, I told you,
I was behind you.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:38.280
Megan thought Ray
had killed Stewart

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:39.440
to protect her,

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:41.480
while Ray thought Megan
had killed Stewart

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:43.040
to escape him,

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:45.760
leading him to chop up
the body and hide the crime.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:49.440
The trauma of the act
caused his mind to blank,

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:51.080
which is why
he doesn't remember

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.440
turning up at Fester's

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:53.960
covered in blood
all those years ago.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.960
You were catatonic,

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.720
just looking
right through me.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.440
It's a tragic
misunderstanding

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:02.040
that tore the couple apart
and forced Cassie

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:05.040
to build an entirely
new life as Megan.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.200
I thought you were dead.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:08.640
I'm sorry.

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:11.560
Who killed Stewart Green?

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.680
So, if not Megan or Ray,

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.960
who did kill the bald bully?

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.800
This one is a shocker.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:22.080
Throughout Stay Close,
we see Detective Broome

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:23.640
investigate a number
of missing men,

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:26.160
all vanishing
around carnival time,

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:28.480
just like Carlton Flynn
and Stewart Green.

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:29.720
Most of us could guess

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.560
there was a serial killer
in the mix,

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.160
but would any of us
have pointed the finger

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.560
at lovely Lorraine?

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.960
Look how happy
she makes James Nesbitt.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:40.760
Yes, Lauren has been
killing men for 18 years.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.800
She started
with her abusive partner.

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:44.640
He had taken
my child's life,

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.280
I had taken his.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.280
And when she saw the threat

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:49.680
Stewart Green
posed to Cassie,

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:51.640
she took care of him too.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:52.680
What are you doing here?

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.080
Lorraine's mistake,

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.240
aside from murdering
nearly 20 people,

00:05:58.320 --> 00:05:59.800
was to lure Cassie
to the body

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.560
by telling her Ray
was waiting for her.

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.920
This caused
the misunderstanding

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.280
that shattered
their relationship.

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:08.040
Also, because Ray found
and chopped up Stewart,

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:09.760
Lorraine couldn't
hide the body

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:10.880
in the underground bunker

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:12.600
where she stored
her other victims,

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:16.240
a whopping 15 bodies
to add to the death toll.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:20.120
Oh, and it was Lorraine
who murdered Guy Tatum.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:23.400
Ray thought he had done it
himself during a blackout,

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.400
but it was our friendly
neighbourhood throat cutter.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.880
She was interrupted by
Carlton Flynn's forest chase

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:29.720
before she could
sneak the body

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:31.200
into her murder hole.

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.720
Speaking of Carlton,

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:35.160
Lorraine claims to have
killed the missing teen,

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.560
which would tie up
Stay Close neatly,

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:40.520
but there's nothing neat
about this sad story.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.160
What happened
to Carlton Flynn?

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:45.320
And so we come full circle

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:48.080
and get back to our original
missing person.

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:50.240
Carlton Flynn was
last seen in Vipers

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.440
hanging out
with two masked girls.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.920
They turned out to be
Megan's daughter Kayleigh

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.360
and her friend Bea.

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:57.400
Having snuck into Vipers,

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:00.480
Bea realises Carlton is
trying to spike their drinks

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:01.680
and switches their glasses

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:03.360
before escaping
with her friend.

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:05.480
The two run into the forest,

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:08.080
that's what forces Lorraine
to abandon Guy's body,

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:09.440
and split up.

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:11.600
Kayleigh leads the drugged
Carlton back to his car

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:13.480
and dumps him in the boot

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:14.720
before the girls
steal the car

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:17.400
and leave it in the forest
when it runs out of petrol.

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:19.880
This explains how Kayleigh
comes to be in possession

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.600
of Carlton's
distinctive necklace.

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:24.000
Kayleigh's dad Dave
then collects the girls

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.960
from the woods and decides
to come back later

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.280
and dispose of Carlton's car
in the lake.

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:29.760
He thinks he's clearing up

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.600
a petty theft
for his daughter,

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:32.640
but unbeknownst to him,

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:33.880
Carlton is still
unconscious,

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:35.880
spiked by his own drugs,

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.320
in the boot of the car.

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:39.040
Help! Help me!

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.040
Kayleigh doesn't know
her dad got rid of the car,

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.360
and Dave doesn't know
the body was in there,

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:47.480
so neither is aware
that Carlton is dead.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.640
That's one last body
for our count,

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:51.680
and one last secret
for Megan to keep

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:54.360
as she puts the horrible
two and two together

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:55.720
on her wedding day.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.200
And so we reached
the end of Stay Close,

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:01.400
with a whopping
24 bodies turning up

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.040
in just eight episodes.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:04.160
If you enjoyed this show,

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:06.320
you should check out
The Stranger and Safe

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:07.760
on Netflix.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.480
Like Stay Close,
they are based

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:11.680
on Harlan Cobain's
twisty thrillers.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:12.920
And if you enjoyed
this video,

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.760
subscribe to
Still Watching Netflix

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.200
for more videos like it.

